      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1952769509254639639",
      "text": "[5:18p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite good in and out of VI, regardless of the high influx of vehicles.\n\n- Ozumba inwards Bonny Camp though on the high side is good; Ozumba inwards Law School and Adetokunbo Ademola is on the high side.\n\n- Akin Adesola is on the high side as well.\n\n- Ahmadu Bello Way is good, though slow at Eko Hotel Roundabout.\n\n- Adeola Odeku is on the high side as well. \n\n- Ajose Adeogun is good, just a bit slow at the Eko Hotel Roundabout.",
